WEBVTT

00:02.183 --> 00:03.902
&lt;i>Previously&lt;/i>
&lt;i>on&lt;/i> Two and a Half Men...

00:03.903 --> 00:06.691
I am gonna ask Lyndsey
to marry me.

00:06.952 --> 00:08.151
Will you marry me?

00:08.153 --> 00:09.886
Yes, I will marry you!

00:09.888 --> 00:12.622
I was wondering if you'd do me
the honor of being my best man.

00:12.624 --> 00:14.057
What?
What?

00:14.059 --> 00:15.692
Larry, where can
I put this poop?

00:15.694 --> 00:17.227
This is my sister Gretchen.
She just moved here.

00:17.229 --> 00:18.995
Gretchen, this is
Jeff Strongman.

00:18.997 --> 00:20.697
I think the computer
just read his thoughts.

00:20.699 --> 00:22.199
(squealing)
(laughs)

00:22.201 --> 00:23.867
Yes!

00:23.869 --> 00:26.670
The guy I had dinner with
last night offered me

00:26.672 --> 00:28.038
