00:28.040 --> 00:29.539
Where does that leave us?

00:29.541 --> 00:30.640
I have to take this.

00:30.642 --> 00:31.975
I'm sorry, buddy.

00:31.977 --> 00:33.510
I'm here for you.

00:33.512 --> 00:34.444
If you wanted to go with her...

00:34.446 --> 00:36.113
Oh, thank God.

00:37.882 --> 00:39.282
I thought
about what you said

00:39.284 --> 00:40.717
I don't want
to work for Google.

00:40.719 --> 00:42.085
