with you.

00:42.087 --> 00:44.054
We're gonna do great things
together.

00:44.056 --> 00:46.223
All right.

00:47.592 --> 00:48.792
So where do I sleep?

00:50.428 --> 00:52.496
♪ &lt;i>Men.&lt;/i> ♪

00:55.266 --> 00:57.234
Uh...

00:57.236 --> 00:58.435
hello?

00:58.437 --> 00:59.769
Oh, hey.

00:59.771 --> 01:01.638
