02:04.670 --> 02:06.870
Something smells good.

02:06.872 --> 02:09.506
That is the cinnamon
French tatas.

02:09.508 --> 02:12.175
Hey, you-you must be Jake.

02:12.177 --> 02:14.544
Give your cousin Jenny a hug.

02:15.313 --> 02:17.981
That's not Jake.
Shut up, Dad.

02:17.983 --> 02:19.983
