02:19.985 --> 02:20.784
Hey, Berta.

02:20.786 --> 02:23.286
Welcome home, Jake.

02:23.288 --> 02:24.321
That's not Jake.

02:24.323 --> 02:26.957
That's Walden's friend Barry.

02:26.959 --> 02:28.058
Uh, Berta,

02:28.060 --> 02:29.559
